Initial ad hoc provenance attempt failed before producing a PASS line. It guessed the Git path for original/full-320.jpg as comps/original/full-320.jpg instead of using the manifest's source field, which points to comps/page-b/shots/full-320.jpg. Git returned path-not-found. This is a verifier mapping error, not a page/source mismatch. Tool stderr was observed in the session, this file documents the failure rather than pretending to be captured stderr. The reproducible verify-privacy-provenance.mjs now uses metadata.source. See privacy-provenance-final.log for the actual passing output.
